{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! All three obligations are verified:\n1. Total farmers markets (excluding territories): 7,942\n2. 2025 US population: 341,784,857  \n3. Farmers markets per 100,000 residents: 2.3237 (rounded to 4 decimal places)\n\nThe checker confirms all values are correct. Now let me check the lineage of the farmers_markets_per_capita alias to make sure the sources are legitimate and re-fetchable.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01K2nN4sDvQN4wkdxohyKKAi","name":"xorq_check_lineage","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","alias":"farmers_markets_per_capita","no_local":true}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":12,"output":222,"cacheRead":20929,"cacheWrite":937,"totalTokens":22100,"cost":{"input":0.000012,"output":0.00111,"cacheRead":0.0020929,"cacheWrite":0.00117125,"total":0.00438615},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":112},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786912755755,"responseId":"msg_011Ce75BAFHUEA7JyRCsYQG5","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01K2nN4sDvQN4wkdxohyKKAi","toolName":"xorq_check_lineage","content":[{"type":"text","text":" ✅ VERIFIED   lineage · farmers_markets_per_capita  ·  2 sources\n   ✓ lineage reaches a source from its root\n   ✓ read_csv(https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv)  via pandas\n   ✓ read_csv(https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv)  via pandas"}],"details":{"alias":"farmers_markets_per_capita","sources":[{"node":"@read_3f612b18e608","op":"Read","method":"read_csv","path":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv","table":"farmers_markets","profile":"beee580ceeacddc83bd6914e17f47319_0","con_name":"pandas","snapshot_hash":"3f612b18e608f1c1c2bf62ee0a528e47"},{"node":"@read_e4674c874922","op"